Package: time
Version: 1.7-r2
Description: Tool that measures CPU resources
 time measures many of the CPU resources, such as time and memory, that
 other programs use.
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv2+
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: time
Homepage: http://www.gnu.org/software/time/
Depends: update-alternatives-opkg, libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: http://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/time/time-1.7.tar.gz file://debian.patch
